1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:49,749
Mira: I thought after what happened last night, you wouldn't want to talk to me anymore. I said some things that were a bit too much...

2
00:00:49,799 --> 00:04:58,548
Michael: Don't worry. I understand. We all have different views about tương lai. But I like hearing about your plans. How long do you định to stay in Saigon?

3
00:04:58,598 --> 00:10:46,847
Mira: Tương lai? I'm not sure anymore. Initially I only định to stay here for a year to teach Russian. But now... there are reasons why I want to stay longer. What about you? Do you have any kế hoạch for your tương lai?

4
00:10:46,897 --> 00:13:16,146
Michael: I always thought I'd return to America after a few years, but there's something about Saigon that makes me not want to leave. Maybe it's the city... or maybe it's someone. Tương lai is hard to predict, isn't it?

5
00:13:16,196 --> 00:15:45,445
Mira: Someone? Don't say such vague things like that. I don't... Fine, maybe I have similar reasons. But tương lai isn't always what we want it to be...

